    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 753,
        "y": 2223,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 60
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "We determined when fights would occur, with which enemies, and how intense they would be.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "normal",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 753,
        "y": 2313,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 60
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "We also established where the puzzles would be located, what elements would be used to solve them, and how difficult they would be.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "normal",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 753,
        "y": 2403,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 60
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Additionally, we outline various 'WOW' moments where we wanted to leave an impact on the player",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "normal",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": -88,
        "y": 2624,
        "w": 739,
        "h": 699
      },
      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1f3734_faa9b11e66834021a9e846c9ccacd5e5~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_739,h_699,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/1f3734_faa9b11e66834021a9e846c9ccacd5e5~mv2.jpg",
      "srcset": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1f3734_faa9b11e66834021a9e846c9ccacd5e5~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_739,h_699,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/1f3734_faa9b11e66834021a9e846c9ccacd5e5~mv2.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1f3734_faa9b11e66834021a9e846c9ccacd5e5~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1478,h_1398,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/1f3734_faa9b11e66834021a9e846c9ccacd5e5~mv2.jpg 2x",
      "alt": "",
