    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 2624,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 35
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "I was involved in designing and creating the 2D layout for all the levels in",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 2659,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Bugs N’ Guns, starting from initial whiteboard sketches and culminating in the final detailed map.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 2729,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 140
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "One of the major challenges we encountered in the level design process was managing the diverse gameplay and multiple biomes, combined with the player’s high mobility and vertical exploration, which complicated the task for our art team to visually complete the levels.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 2869,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Consequently, our design strategy emphasized reusing areas efficiently while ensuring varied gameplay with minimal adjustments.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 2974,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 35
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Three clear examples illustrate this approach from our initial 2D layout.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 3044,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 35
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "First, we designed two large arenas that players revisit.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 3079,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 105
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "By incorporating new elements upon reentry, such as the weapons available at that stage and slight changes in the environment, we create distinctly different gameplay experiences each time players enter these arenas.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 3219,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 105
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Second, we developed three smaller arenas intended for more static combat. These arenas share identical wall and ceiling designs, allowing us to reuse most of the level’s decorative elements.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 3324,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "By altering the floor layout, enemy placements, and train positions, each of these arenas maintains a unique feel.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 3429,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Lastly, the entry and exit passages of the largest arena are symmetrical caves, which eliminates the need for duplicating decorative efforts.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 3499,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "These sections focus on platforming, with a twist. In one, players are required to chase the train, while in the other, they use the train as a platform.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": 752,
        "y": 3569,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "By designing a single, symmetrical passageway, we achieve two distinct platforming experiences.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
